text.en:
While a turret is deployed, Ruinscribe Turret Mode is replaced with a laser designator that marks enemies for 30 seconds.

Firing at a target marks them; firing at a surface marks all enemies within a 6 meter radius. Turret prioritizes marked targets, firing three <pve 274 /> <pvp [?] /> damage missiles every 1.65 seconds.

